ht family, rebelling against her cold default demeanor as she warms to Shirogane and the rest of her friends.\n\n\n\nMeanwhile, council treasurer Yuu Ishigami suffers under the weight of his hopeless crush on Tsubame Koyasu, a popular upperclassman who helps to instill a new confidence in him. Miko Iino, the newest student council member, grows closer to the rule-breaking Ishigami while striving to overcome her own authoritarian moral code.\n\n\n\nAs love further blooms at Shuchiin Academy, the student council officers drag their outsider friends into increasingly comedic conflicts.\n\n\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)\n\n\n\nNote: The first episode had an advanced screening on April 2, in both New York & Los Angeles."],"ja":["かぐや様は告らせたい-ウルトラロマンティック-",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-42100":"2024-01-02T12:11:18Z","serial-41986":"2022-06-24T18:04:15Z","serial-41988":"2023-01-05T10:36:03Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-42100","serial-41986","serial-41988"],"relatedMalIds":[40591,52198],"rating":8.95,"relations":[{"id":40591,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":52198,"relation":"sequel"}],"availableEpisodeCount":13}]}